# PRD s6 integration
Read every source file before editing it, including before formatter auto-fixes: inspect lint file names then read their complete contents.
Only fix reported prettier/prettier and prefer-const errors. Do not silence rules, change lint config, rewrite tests, or change behavior.
Never run manual builds or typechecks: Lovable harness handles them automatically.
Run bunx eslint src, fix only offending files after reading, rerun eslint and bunx vitest run.
No git commands, installs, OpenCode nested agents, secrets reads or environment dumps.
Do not modify central pillars, opencode.json, AGENTS.md, src/routeTree.gen.ts, src/server.ts unless named by lint and formatter-only.
Report has done/evidence/decisions/blockers/out-of-scope/changed-files sections.
Use best matching existing tools and skills for reading, editing, and tests, but follow these harness prohibitions over old central gates.
Technical decisions: none beyond existing architecture; formatting only.
